    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46579" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡβ-άσκω</span></b> , Incept. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡβάω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>come to
				puberty</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				3.28
			</span></i>. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				4.6.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παῖς ἡβάσκων ἄρτι</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.4.7
			</span></i>; of women, <i>become marriageable</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
			</span></i>inc.<i><span class="en">
				2.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῦν ἔθ᾽ ἡβάσκει κακόν</span>
			(read by <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
			</span></i> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡβᾷ σοι</span>) <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				1085
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμῖν ἡβάσκει πενίη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.30
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Maced.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιητικὴ οὔπω ἡβάσκουσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Her.Praef.</u>
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>reach</i>, or <i>show the outward signs of, manhood</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Aristaenet.
				1.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Im.</u>
				2.7
			</span></i>.</div>
